{"id":"g-ir-generate.1","n":"g-ir-generate","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"gobject-introspection","ver":"1.72.0-1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/g/gobject-introspection/gobject-introspection_1.72.0-1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/g-ir-generate.1.gz","sha256":"cd2efdfa2136bf59859f088b417f4bb85dba0f18f199163a0e0045116af830ec","date":"","origin":""}},"nopt":{"u":4},"desc":"Typelib generator","u":[["NAME","<p>g-ir-generate - Typelib generator</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>g-ir-generate</b> [OPTION...] FILES...</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>g-ir-generate is an GIR generator, using the repository API. It generates GIR files from a raw typelib or in a shared library (<b>--shlib</b>). The output will be written to standard output unless the <b>--output</b> is specified.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--help</b></dt><dd>Show help options</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--shlib<b>=</b></b><i><b>FILENAME</b></i></dt><dd>The shared library to read the symbols from.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--output<b>=</b></b><i><b>FILENAME</b></i></dt><dd>Save the resulting output in FILENAME.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--version</b></dt><dd>Show program's version number and exit</dd></dl> </div> <br>"],["BUGS","<p>Report bugs at <i>https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gobject-introspection/issues</i></p>"],["HOMEPAGE AND CONTACT","<p><i>https://gi.readthedocs.io/</i></p>"],["AUTHORS","<p>Mattias Clasen</p>"]]}